codex
The suite exposed a cache compatibility issue: `guide app` compares certificate JSON exactly, so it rejected the new source metadata. I fixed that comparison to exclude the `sources` field while still checking the executable certificate. I also updated the guide regression to use the surviving missing-bound family.

The owner-stop failures report `E_OWNER_STOP_TIMEOUT`, matching the sandbox limitation noted in the brief. I’m keeping those separate from the other failures.
